/*
  PDFRender - Windows BMP decoding.  See h/pdfbmp.

  Written from the documented BITMAPFILEHEADER / BITMAPINFOHEADER
  layouts.  The awkward corners that real files hit are handled:
  bottom-up storage (the usual case) and top-down (negative height),
  4-byte row padding, palettes shorter than the depth implies, RLE4/8
  including their delta and absolute escapes, and BI_BITFIELDS with
  arbitrary channel masks rather than only the 555/565 defaults.

  Copyright (c) RISC OS Technologies 2026.
